---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Work - Prithvi J" active="work">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-label">Work</div>
    <div class="section-body">
      <h1>Work shaped by real files, real users, and production constraints.</h1>
      <p class="intro-copy">
        I’ve worked on AI workflows, document extraction systems, automation tools, and
        full-stack apps. My focus is not just building demos, but making systems that work
        with real files, real users, and real constraints.
      </p>
      <div class="entry-list">
        <article class="entry">
          <div class="meta">UST Global<br />Associate 2, Data Engineering<br />Aug 2025 - Present</div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>AI workflow and data systems</h3>
            <p>
              Built a customer feedback dashboard that replaced a 6+ hour Excel review process
              with seconds-level structured insight generation for an internal executive team.
            </p>
            <p>
              Owned the React dashboard, agentic chat layer, RAG flow over MySQL feedback data,
              Bedrock prompt orchestration, and production deployment on AWS EC2.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">React</span>
              <span class="tag">FastAPI</span>
              <span class="tag">LangChain</span>
              <span class="tag">AWS Bedrock</span>
              <span class="tag">MySQL</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="entry">
          <div class="meta">Adrovel<br />Cofounder & Backend Engineer<br />Dec 2024 - Jan 2025</div>
          <div class="entry-content">
            <h3>Startup building and backend work</h3>
            <p>
              Co-founded Adrovel and helped build three apps: appointment scheduling, debt
              tracking, and an X media management platform.
            </p>
            <p>
              Worked on backend systems, CI/CD pipelines, streaming app deployments, and release
              efficiency for fast product iteration.
            </p>
            <div class="tags">
              <span class="tag">Backend</span>
              <span class="tag">CI/CD</span>
              <span class="tag">Deployments</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
